```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__emulator_newtonscript","description":"Evaluate one line of NewtonScript inside the emulator through the Einstein control socket. Refused on the shared emulator without an instance.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__emulator_newtonscript(args: {
  instance?: string;
  // one line, e.g. GetRoot().|Foo:jbfly|:Open();
  source: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__emulator_screen","description":"Screenshot the 320x480 Newton screen of an Einstein emulator and return it as an image. Allowed on the shared emulator.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__emulator_screen(args: {
  // isolated instance name; omit for the shared emulator
  instance?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__emulator_tap","description":"Tap the Newton screen at (x, y) in 320x480 screen coordinates. Refused on the shared emulator without an instance.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__emulator_tap(args: { instance?: string; x: number; y: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__emulator_text","description":"Type text into the emulator window via xdotool. Refused on the shared emulator without an instance.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__emulator_text(args: { instance?: string; value: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__newton_tool","description":"Call a fixed operation on the Newton tools client over the pkg_publisher broker (POST /tools on 18081). Works against whichever Newton is polling -- the physical MessagePad or an emulator with networking. Read-only ops available today: ping, front_app, note_list, get_note, note_probe, battery, store_info, pkg_list. Ops that would change the device are refused and handed back as a command for the human.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__newton_tool(args: {
  // operation arguments, e.g. {"id": 1}
  args?: { [key: string]: unknown; };
  // operation name, e.g. front_app
  op: string;
  // seconds to wait for the Newton (default 20, max 120)
  timeout?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"},{"name":"mcp__newton__write_source","description":"Replace Main.newt in one project directly under runtime/agent-workspace/. This tool cannot write elsewhere.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__newton__write_source(args: {
  // project created by create_project
  project: string;
  // complete Main.newt source
  source: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```"}]

